  <h1>FAQ's</h1>
  <h2>How do you choose which AI tools to list?</h2>
  <p>A person checks every tool: the site works, it says clearly what it does, and it's useful to normal people or small businesses.</p>
  <h2>Do companies pay to be listed?</h2>
  <p>Some do. Paying gets a faster review (Fast Track) or a top spot (Featured), and Featured spots are always marked "FEATURED". Paying never skips the review.</p>
  <h2>What does "(aff)" mean?</h2>
  <p>It's an affiliate link: if you sign up, we may earn a commission. It costs you nothing extra and doesn't change which tools we list.</p>
  <h2>Why does the site look like 2001?</h2>
  <p>Because that's when we built it. <a href="/about/">Read the story</a>.</p>
  <h2>How do I contact you?</h2>
